# The renovation preview build (#69, architecture §11). `vite build --mode renovation` reads this
# file; no other mode does, so production stays flag-off. It is a file rather than a shell variable
# because Vite exposes `VITE_*` to client code only from `.env` files: `src/app/channel.ts` decides
# the database name by scanning `import.meta.env` for any `VITE_FF_*`, and a preview build is the
# only thing that writes to `buildbox-preview` — which is where the Playwright preview seeds go.
# `npm run test:e2e:renovation` is the command that builds with this mode.
VITE_FF_RENOVATION=true
